<p>Your knowledge of physical laws allows you to use and improve equipment in ways their creators never dreamed.</p><p>Increases all stats, saves, armour, and defense bonuses by <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">4%, 7%, 10%, 12%, 15%</acronym> on equipment that is crafted by a master or powered by steamtech.</p>